  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Guide your car through a top-down course, either gathering all &quot;GAS&quot; icons (similar to Pac-Man) or pushing all boulders into the &quot;PIT&quot; icons (similar to Sokoban), then heading to the &quot;GOAL&quot; icon. A homebrew built with the Puzzle Maker toolset and released in 2022 for the 2022 NESDev Compo and later expanded (the &quot;FV&quot; version) with more levels, an undo-button, and the Sokoban-style mode."
    }
  ],
